<title>USA: FMC Corp Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>FMC Corp Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.44		    $1.51</p>
<p> Net			 54,600		   57,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,278,100		1,174,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,100		   37,800</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 results include losses from discontinued operations of $4.7 million or $0.12/shr vs $500,000 or $0.01/shr. 1995 Q3 includes non-recurring gain from the sale of a 20 percent equity interest in FMC's soda ash business.  </p>
<p>		  9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 4.37		    $4.97</p>
<p> Net			166,100		  187,200</p>
<p> Revs		   3,678,000		3,321,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  38,000		   37,700</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month results include losses from discontinued operations of $7.4 million or $0.19/shr vs $5.2 million or $0.14/shr.</p>
<p>1995 results include $134.5 million in restructuring and other charges.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
